        "responsibility": "Own durable scenario J with exactly empty, [Commit(R)] or [Cancel(R)] as its complete value. Provision a different empty J and fixed R per scenario and retain J throughout that scenario. Permit one atomic durable append from empty and make decided J immutable. Commit supplies one grant and one logical map return. Cancel supplies permanent decline, zero grants and one logical map return. Couple effects to the durable transition so after-append crashes retain the decision and its effects while recovery rendering preserves their counts. Apply the specified storage-success assumption. Before crashes leave empty J and after crashes leave exactly the target record.",
        "uses": []
      },
