        "id": "rendered-map-ui",
        "proposed_owner_key": "reward-controller implementer",
        "requirement_ids": [
          "proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1",
          "proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2",
          "proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-3"
        ],
        "responsibility": "Own volatile rendered UI. Every process initially shows Idle. Ordinary finalization automatically renders Idle for empty J, MapReady for Commit or MapCancelled for Cancel before Complete. Repeated accept after Commit and cancel after Commit preserve MapReady and the grant. Repeated cancel after Cancel and accept after Cancel preserve MapCancelled and permanent decline. Keep UI/J unchanged during independent post-completion reads. Preserve established business-effect and logical-return counts during presentation and restoration.",
        "uses": [
