        ],
        "responsibility": "Retain scenario reward/journal bindings, owned handles and instance tokens, every fresh issued call id, ordered per-instance C events and receipt times, startup/call/exit clock origins, independent observations, ObservationComplete markers, final event counts and latched failures. Preserve the ledger across ordinary restart and crash recovery. Continue Ready, hook and completion audits through each EOF/drain. Require one Complete per ordinary invocation, zero per crash target and exactly one correct Ready already observed by its startup deadline. Preserve failures detected after provisional progression, late Ready, later crashes and cleanup. Scenario acceptance includes final normal exit and complete audits, and failed-test cleanup receives zero coverage credit.",
